#: data/maps/FallarborTown_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:44
msgctxt "FallarborTown_ContestHall_Text_DoAllRightInPreliminary"
msgid ""
"We do all right in the preliminary round,\n"
"but we can never win the appeals…\p"
"Maybe it means I have to watch what\n"
"other contestants are doing…$"
msgstr ""
"我们在预赛中表现得还不错，\n"
"可表演赛却总是赢不了……\p"
"也许我得好好看看其他参赛者是\n"
"怎么做的……$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:51
msgctxt "FallarborTown_ContestHall_Text_MonAllTheseRibbons"
msgid ""
"See!\n"
"My POKéMON won all these RIBBONS!\p"
"Have your POKéMON earned any RIBBONS?\n"
"You can check them on your POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""
"你看！这些奖章都是我的宝可梦赢来的！\p"
"你的宝可梦赢过奖章吗？\n"
"可以用宝可导航查看哦。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:58
msgctxt "FallarborTown_ContestHall_Text_CantWinEverywhere"
msgid ""
"I can't beat GYM LEADERS…\p"
"I can't win any CONTESTS…\p"
"I've been here, there, and everywhere,\n"
"and it's all for naught…$"
msgstr ""
"我打不赢道馆馆主……\p"
"华丽大赛也赢不了……\p"
"我到处跑来跑去，结果全都白费了……$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_BattleTentCorridor/scripts.inc:65
msgctxt "FallarborTown_ContestHall_Text_SuperRankStage"
msgid ""
"POKéMON CONTESTS\n"
"SUPER RANK STAGE!$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦华丽大赛\n"
"超级级别会场！$"
